  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphomala kugomba maneno higa, wauka na anafundzie. Avuka uphande wanjina wa dete ra Kedironi, na achendainjira chunga cha mizaituni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juda, ariyemsalata Jesu, kala anaumanya munda hinyo, mana Jesu na anafundzie kala achiphiya mara kpwa mara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi walongoza chikosi cha asikari a Chirumi phamwenga na arindzi a Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu, ambao kala akahumwa ni Mafarisayo na akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka. Hara asikari na arindzi kala akatsukula taa, vimwindi na silaha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi kpwa vira Jesu kala anamanya gosi ndigomphaha, wadzilavya na achiauza, “Mnaendza ani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara atu achiamba, “Hunaendza Jesu kula Nazareti.” Nao achiambwa, “Ni mimi.” Juda, yemsalata, kala aimire phamwenga nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphoamba, “Ni mimi,” hara atu auya nyuma na achigbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiauza tsona, “Mnaendza ani?” Nao achiamba, “Amba hunaendza Jesu kula Nazareti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye achiaamba, “Amba nkakuambirani kare kukala ni mimi. Ichikala munaniendza, phahi aricheni hinya atu aphiye vyao.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa gahendeka ili arigogomba wakati kala anavoya gatimiye, “Baba, osi urionipha siangamizire hata mmwenga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Simoni Petero kala ana upanga, wautsomola na achikata sikiro ra kulume ra mtumwa wa mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu. (Hiye mtumwa kala achiihwa Maliko.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 26:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 14:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 22:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuamba Petero, “Haka! Haka! Uyiza upangao chowani! Mateso higa nápangirwa ni Baba Mlungu, kpwadze gasiniphahe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi chira chikosi cha asikari na chilongozi wao phamwenga na hara arindzi a Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu amgbwira Jesu na achimfunga mikowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwandzo amphirika kpwa Anasi, mtsedza wa Kayafa. Kayafa kala ndiye mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu mwaka uho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.11.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 11:49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.11.50"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye kala akaambira vilongozi a Chiyahudi kukala ni baha mutu mmwenga afwe kpwa sababu ya atu osi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni Petero wamlunga-lunga Jesu phamwenga na mwanafundzi wanjina ambaye kala anamanywa pho kaya pha mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu. Mutu hiye wainjira ndani ya muhala wa mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu phamwenga na Jesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela Petero achisala phara mryangoni. Yuya wanjina ambaye kala anamanywa pho kaya watuluka kondze, na bada ya kugomba na msichana yekala anaimirira mryango, wamuinjiza ndani Petero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya msichana yekala mryangoni wamuuza Petero, “Kale piya we u mwanafundzi wa hiye mutu achiyegbwirwa?” Petero achiamba, “Hata, mino simi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa sababu ya mnyevu, hara arindzi na atumishi a mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu kala akakuta moho wa makala anaoha. Petero naye kala aimire phapho anaoha moho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mo nyumbani, mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yani Anasi. Anasi kala ni mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu hadi wakati ambao Arumi kala akamuhenda Kayafa, mtsedzawe, kukala mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu. Dzagbwe Ayahudi anjina aharira kukala Anasi ndiye mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kala anamuuza Jesu kuhusu anafundzie na mafundzoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuamba, “Chila wakati kala nchifundza atu chingʼangʼa masinagogini na ndani ya Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu, ambako Ayahudi osi nkukusanyika. Nami siyagomba chochosi chisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwadze unaniuza maswali? Uza atu arionisikira, aho anamanya nrigogomba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphomala kugomba maneno higo, mrindzi mmwenga ariyekala aimire phephi naye wamuwanga kofi ra uso na achimuamba, “Vyo ndivyo ambavyo mutu anaweza kumjibu mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achimuambira yuya mutu, “Ichikala nkagomba makosa, hebu sema makosa nchigogomba. Ela ichikala nkagomba sawa, kpwa utu wani unanipiga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye Anasi walagiza Jesu aphirikpwe kpwa Kayafa, mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, kuno akafungbwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati Simoni Petero kala aimire anaoha moho, hara ayae amuamba, “Kale piya we u mwanafundzi wa hiye mutu achiyegbwirwa?” Ela Petero watsamalala achiamba, “Aa! Mino simi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtumishi mmwenga wa mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, mʼbari wa yuya yekatwa sikiro ni Petero, wamuuza, “Avi nkakuona ngiri-ngiri naye kura mundani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero achimtsamalala tsona Jesu, na phapho hipho dzogolo richiika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya phiriye kuriphocha, Jesu waphirikpwa hadi dzumba ra Pilato, liwali wa jimbo ra Chirumi, kula kpwa Kayafa. Ela vilongozi a Chiyahudi enye taainjirire mo dzumbani ili asedze akatiywa najisi (mana kulengana na mila za Chiyahudi, kala achiinjira nyumba ya mutu asiyekala Myahudi, andakahazwa kusherekeya Sikukuu ya Pasaka). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Pilato watuluka kondze kukutana nao na achiauza, “Yuno mutu, munamshitaki na makosa gani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achiamba, “Kalapho mutu hiyu kahendere makosa, tahungemreha kpwako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato achiaambira, “Phahi halani mutu wenu mkamhukumu kulengana na shariya zenu.” Ela hara vilongozi a Chiyahudi achimuamba, “Shariya za Chirumi tazihuruhusu kuolaga mutu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.3.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 3:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa gahendeka ili arigogomba Jesu dzulu ya ndivyofwa gatimiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Johana 12:32–33.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Pilato wauya tsona ndani ya dzumbare, achilagiza Jesu arehwe. Ariphorehwa himo ndani, Pilato wamuuza, “We ndiwe Mfalume wa Ayahudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiamba, “Gano ugombago ni gako uwe ama ukaambirwa ni atu anjina kunihusu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato achiamba, “Kpwani mino ni Myahudi? Atuo mwenye a kabilaro, akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka ndio achiokureha kpwangu. Dze, wakosani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achiamba, “Ufalume wangu sio wa dunia hino. Kalapho ufalume wangu ni wa dunia hino, atumishi angu angebwaga viha ili nisigbwirwe ni vilongozi a Chiyahudi. Ni mfalume kpweli, ela ufalume wangu sio wa hipha duniani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Pilato achimuamba, “Kpwa hivyo we u mfalume!” Naye achiamba, “Uwe unaamba kukala ni mfalume, nawe u sawa. Mana nákpwedza mu duniani na kuvyalwa ili nifundze atu kuhusu kpweli. Chila ariye wa kpweli nkuniphundza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilato achimuuza, “Kpweli nini?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kugomba higo, Pilato watuluka kondze tsona kokala na vilongozi a Chiyahudi, achiaambira, “Mutu hiyu simuonere na kosa rorosi ra kumshitakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kpwa vira ni kawaida yenu mvugurirwe mfungbwa mmwenga chila Sikukuu ya Pasaka, munaambadze nchikuvugurirani Mfalume wa Ayahudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nyo akota kululu achiamba, “Usimvugule hiye, huvugurire Baraba!” (Baraba wakala ni mpindzani wa serikali.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:40",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kpwa Chiyunani neno hiri manage ganjina ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mkora.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
